<?ish ishref="GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38" version="1" lang="en-US"?><task id="GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38" xml:lang="en-US"> 
  <title id="GUID-7830ABD8-C0F7-472D-8339-F2D40FA42B99">Improve Copy Quality</title> 
  <shortdesc>If the quality of your copies does not meet your expectations, there are common causes to address. 
  </shortdesc> 
  <prolog> 
	 <metadata> 
		<keywords> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="MODEL=810AIO">810AIO</keyword> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="MODEL=820AIO">820AIO</keyword> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="MODEL=910AIO">910AIO</keyword> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="MODEL=920AIO">920AIO</keyword> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="Series='800_Series'"> 800 Series</keyword> 
		  <keyword ishcondition="Series='900_Series'"> 900 Series</keyword> 
		  <keyword>Acadian</keyword> 
		  <indexterm>copying<indexterm>improving quality</indexterm></indexterm> 
		  <indexterm>quality<indexterm>improving copy</indexterm></indexterm> 
		</keywords> </metadata>
  </prolog> 
  <taskbody> 
	 <prereq id="PREREQ_21C5833034E4449EB7DDA1D8D4E5F2F3">Perform the 
		<xref href="GUID-8BBCB12E-75F4-45D6-B209-DB3F3FDAE8A9">Improve Print Quality</xref> steps. 
	 </prereq> 
	 <context id="GUID-6D3E3495-C23F-4D51-806C-D7C153676BCC"> 
		<p>Common causes of poor copy quality are: 
		<ul id="UL_8BE7C93541294E8F95362CD56B196898"> 
		  <li id="LI_A96CDE2139014E16B98AF55F7E21AFC6">Mismatched paper size with the size of the original document. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_8134520907C840369CC191853379D4D2">Original document is not properly loaded. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_9EC29F3BFCD24BC0A33FE4C870815983">Original document is loaded with the wrong side facing up. 
		  </li> 
		  <li id="LI_286B3B485AF1466297C4A31D5F3DEC21">There is dirt on the original document or in the printer. 
		  </li> 
		</ul> 
		</p> 
	 </context> 
	 <steps id="GUID-45D61AA0-E06B-4191-8977-0B830BA1BC16"> 
		<step id="STEP_EE1552D3E5CA47FB838DED98E5483D00"> 
		  <cmd>Is the copy missing content at the bottom of the page? 
		  </cmd> 
		  <choices id="CHOICES_B8E35BE8E1E3476EBD4905812BFC41E0"> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_B5C9F69F5A7745E5B2AEDD1DEE5A8824">If Yes, then the paper is shorter than your original document and you must replace the paper with paper of the proper size. 
			 </choice> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_5C95F4CF61004DBE9268C2CC496D3A2D">If No, then go to 
				<xref href="GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38#GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38/STEP_41E42DA603E547A59107A9C172B0AE18">step 2</xref>. 
			 </choice> 
		  </choices> 
		</step> 
		<step id="STEP_41E42DA603E547A59107A9C172B0AE18"> 
		  <cmd>Is copy crooked? 
		  </cmd> 
		  <choices id="CHOICES_505A12DB64484F79B91BBFAC73FF0D1E"> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_F0D4DCC52D8F49B6897406C37FFFBCC7">If Yes, then adjust the original in the ADF or on the Document Glass. 
			 </choice> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_918FD358FA7D4CBA9D6984A962ED44BF">In No, then go to 
				<xref href="GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38#GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38/STEP_BF3EA921A90E4540928AFA81DBBBAA89">step 3</xref>. 
			 </choice> 
		  </choices> 
		</step> 
		<step id="STEP_BF3EA921A90E4540928AFA81DBBBAA89"> 
		  <cmd>Is the copy blank? 
		  </cmd> 
		  <choices id="CHOICES_0E96D88370CB47CDB368DEC962BDEFC9"> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_F83242DA72114D52A618A1734D7EE502">If Yes, then the original is facing the way and you must load it with the right side facing down. 
			 </choice> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_1759922DAB0F40DCA9450447CA16B1F3">In No, then go to 
				<xref href="GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38#GUID-A169B668-1FAA-455D-95D4-70AE83EAAA38/STEP_6162F409962247D3B5143B47C457546D">step 4</xref>. 
			 </choice> 
		  </choices> 
		</step> 
		<step id="STEP_6162F409962247D3B5143B47C457546D"> 
		  <cmd>Does the copy have marks or smudges on it? 
		  </cmd> 
		  <choices id="CHOICES_961ED1B3DD3945EBA2ECC3CC6C8A9565"> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_E604705F2445433D9A7E635860F83390">If Yes, then there is dirt on the original document, in the ADF or on the Document Glass, which you need to remove. 
			 </choice> 
			 <choice id="CHOICE_A0E1617C361143ADBF528D37B4E8DDC3">In No, then go to the 
				<ph varref="company_name_short">Acadian, Inc.</ph> web site(<ph ishcondition="Region=NA"> 
				  <xref conref="GUID-F350E035-AB00-49FB-AD74-C1DE90681530#GUID-F350E035-AB00-49FB-AD74-C1DE90681530/US_URL"></xref> 
				</ph><ph ishcondition="Region in (EU,PR)"> 
				  <xref conref="GUID-F350E035-AB00-49FB-AD74-C1DE90681530#GUID-F350E035-AB00-49FB-AD74-C1DE90681530/GERMAN_URL"></xref> 
				</ph>. 
			 </choice> 
		  </choices> 
		</step> 
	 </steps> 
  </taskbody> 
</task>
